 "caption": "Customers message at midnight, and the free WhatsApp Business app can already answer for you. Under Tools it has three basics: a greeting message for new chats, an away message for when you are closed, and quick replies for questions you answer all day.\n\nIt is not a chatbot, and quick replies still need a tap from you. When you want replies that work without you, that takes a proper automation.\n\nWant it set up for your shop? DM us the word REPLY and we'll show you how.\n\n#moodbod #automation #smallbusinessnamibia #windhoek #whatsappbusiness\n\nSources: WhatsApp Business (whatsappbusiness.com), eesel.ai, Meetergo."
